{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04579","headline":"游洞庭湖湘 · 张说","name":"游洞庭湖湘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缅邈洞庭岫，葱蒙水雾色。\n宛在太湖中，可望不可即。\n剖竹守穷渚，开门对奇域。\n城池自絷笼，缨绶爲徽纆。\n靡日不思往，经时始愿克。\n飞棹越溟波，维舟恣攀陟。\n䆗窱入云步，崎岖倚松息。\n岩坛有鹤过，壁字无人识。\n滴石香乳溜，垂崖灵草植。\n玩幽轻雾阻，讨异忘曛逼。\n寒沙际水平，霜树笼烟直。\n空宫闻莫覩，地道窥难测。\n此处学金丹，何人生羽翼。\n谁传九光要，几拜三仙职。\n紫气徒想像，清潭长眇默。\n霓裳若有来，觏我云峰侧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}